classDiagram
    class Farmer {
      +int id
      +string name
      +string phone
      +string password
      +string location
      +datetime created_at
      +register()
      +login()
    }
    class CropLog {
      +int id
      +int farmer_id
      +string crop
      +date planting_date
      +date harvest_date
      +string status
      +string location
      +string notes
      +datetime created_at
      +create()
      +findByFarmer()
      +update()
      +delete()
    }
    class Crop {
      +string id
      +string name
      +string planting
      +string pest
      +string harvest
      +getInfo(topic)
    }
    class USSDHandler {
      +string sessionId
      +string phoneNumber
      +string text
      +handleRequest()
      +validateInput()
      +paginate()
    }
    class AuthService {
      +hashPassword()
      +comparePassword()
      +signToken()
      +verifyToken()
    }
    class OfflineStore {
      +getAll()
      +replaceAll()
    }

    Farmer "1" --> "*" CropLog : records
    CropLog ..> Crop : references
    Farmer ..> AuthService : uses
    USSDHandler ..> Crop : reads guides
    CropLog ..> OfflineStore : cached offline
